{"title": "沙发上的哲学家", "index": 7, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<p class=\"calibre_9\" id=\"filepos38674\"><span class=\"calibre1\">第二章</span></p><blockquote class=\"calibre_17\"><blockquote class=\"calibre_18\">我们每个人都能在内心深处分清是非黑白，正义便由此产生。</blockquote></blockquote><div class=\"mbp_pagebreak\" id=\"calibre_pb_6\"></div>\n</body>"}]}